{"id":"enorme","lemma":"enorme","pos":"adj","rank":958,"glosses":["enormous, huge"],"ipa":"/eˈnoɾme/","forms":{"femininePlural":"enormes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-enorme.wav","examples":[{"text":"La red es enorme.","en":"The net is huge.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636433"},{"text":"Las olas son enormes.","en":"The waves are enormous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604505"},{"text":"Este lugar es enorme.","en":"This place is huge.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501452"},{"text":"Las playas de Hawái son famosas por sus enormes olas.","en":"The beaches in Hawaii are famous for their huge waves."},{"text":"Necesito un favor enorme.","en":"I need a huge favor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449540"}]}